# The compiled Swift helper. A build artifact, never committed.
#
# Glob rather than one literal name: the product rename produced
# hexa-speech-helper and hexavoice-speech-helper, neither of which matched
# the single old entry here, so both got committed as ~98KB binaries without
# anyone noticing. Worse, a stale one on a developer's machine satisfies
# find_helper()'s dev-layout fallback and masks a real name mismatch between
# the bundle script and crates/asr.
*-speech-helper
